 "id": "ll_red_sky",
 "title": "Raiders under a Red Sky",
 "kind": "hero",
 "seed": 4707,
 "intro": [
  "One morning the sky is red and stays red. Ash falls like snow. Word comes from the north: the Frostmarch clans are over the border under a reaver called Bjarr Coldhand, burning granaries. Their summer never came, and the Concord stopped sending grain long ago.",
  "The army is far to the south. Aldous rides north with the few who are with him.",
  "Save what granaries you can, find out what the clans want, and drive Bjarr Coldhand back over the border."
 ],
 "outro": [
  {
   "if": {
    "flag": "hrodna_fed"
   },
   "text": [
    "The last raider dies laughing. \"Your sky did this,\" he says. \"Your fire. We are only hungry.\"",
    "Clan Grimfell goes home over the pass with Coldwater's grain on their sledges. To the south-east, beyond the ash, the horizon glows."
   ]
  },
  {
   "if": {
    "flag": "hrodna_turned"
   },
   "text": [
    "The last raider dies laughing. \"Your sky did this,\" he says. \"Your fire. We are only hungry.\"",
    "Hrodna's clan lies in the snow beside him. Coldwater keeps its grain. To the south-east, beyond the ash, the horizon glows."
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": [
    "The last raider dies laughing. \"Your sky did this,\" he says. \"Your fire. We are only hungry.\"",
    "To the south-east, beyond the ash, the horizon glows."
